  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription -> An ancient dungeon appeared around the colony, attracting various treasure hunters. However,the underground insects and ancient Mechanical appear together in the dungeon, they wandered in the dungeon and attacked greedy individuals who coveted the treasure.</li>
  -->
  <DG_Quest_Dungeon.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription -> 一座古老的地牢在殖民地的周围出现，古老的财宝吸引着各种狩猎财宝的猎人，但一同出现的还有地下的虫族与古老的机械族，它们在地牢中游荡攻击那些觊觎财宝的贪婪者。</li>
  </DG_Quest_Dungeon.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName -> [DungeonAdj] dungeon</li>
  -->
  <DG_Quest_Dungeon.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName -> [DungeonAdj]地牢</li>
  </DG_Quest_Dungeon.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Dungeon disappeared -->
  <DG_Quest_Dungeon.root.nodes.DungeonDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>地牢消失了</DG_Quest_Dungeon.root.nodes.DungeonDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The ancient dungeon has been completely searched and wiped out, and it will disappear into the tide of history. -->
