  <!-- EN: The dungeon  disappeared into the tide of history. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <DG_Quest_Dungeon.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>地牢消失于历史的浪潮之中，任务[resolvedQuestName]已失效。</DG_Quest_Dungeon.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
